{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10292","headline":"春和杜相公移入长兴宅奉呈诸宰执 · 皇甫曾","name":"春和杜相公移入长兴宅奉呈诸宰执","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欲向幽偏适，还从绝地移。\n秦官鼎食贵，尧世土阶卑。\n戟户槐阴满，书窗竹叶垂。\n才分午夜漏，遥隔万年枝。\n北阙深恩在，东林远梦知。\n日斜门掩暎，山远树参差。\n论道齐鸳翼，题诗忆凤池。\n从公亦何幸，长与佩声随。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫曾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10292.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10292","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}